What systems are required and their purpose:

- Battery                 == Provide stable power at a constant rate
- Power module            == High current power distribution and battery monitoring
- Flight controller       == Autonomous navigation flight logging and stabilization 
--- GPS                   == Return to launch waypoint navigation and position holding 
--- ELRS Reciever         == Pilot control manuel override and flight mode selection 
--- Telementary Radio     == Aircraft monitor mission upload and log download 
--- Camera                == Navigation 
--- ESCs                  == Maintain stable distributuion 
----- Motors              == Provide thrust for heavy payloads
------- Propellers        == Maintain stability in wind
- Frame                   == Support heavy payloads rigid structure provide modular mounting points
- Payload system          == Thermal camera mapping camera and future research payloads
- Companion computer      == Computer vision and AI algorithms image processing and decisions
- Expansion interfaces    == Additional room ports and power outputs for future developement
